X     A third interface is the  _M_a_i_l  (pronounced  _c_a_p  _m_a_i_l)
Xinterface,  available  with the -_M option.  This invokes the
X_M_a_i_l program directly, and allows you to read news with  the
Xsame  commands  as  you  read mail.  (This interface may not
Xwork on your system - it requires a special version of  Mail
Xwith a -_T option.)
